/T (Countryside Era is a trend that has quietly taken over social media. Instead of showing city life, users post pictures of dirt roads, linen dresses, homemade bread, and quiet mornings in the countryside. It isn't about moving to a farm - it's a mood built around calm, simplicity, and appreciating ordinary things.)
