/Title (Many people compare this trend to cottagecore, but they aren't quite the same. Cottagecore is fairy-tale and romantic, full of floral dresses and rose gardens. Countryside Era is broader and more everyday; it can be a herb garden on a balcony or a simple trip to a farmers' market.)
